      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0011.md",
        "extractedDay": 11,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.008Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-24r4am",
      "text": "Clausen! Four wins deep, don't look at me like I'm a paperwork violation waiting to happen - some of us are just built different, or built fast, same thing really. Rent's due Friday but my luck isn't, so if Hell's briefcase is looking for volunteers, put me on the do-not-call list.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 4,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0013.md",
        "extractedDay": 13,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.009Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-ieobf9",
      "text": "General, four wins straight, I could roll dice against your own doctors and still make rent this month. Just the once though. Speaking of, your new guy owes half the building money and the other half apologies, figured you'd want the receipts before he dies again and forgets.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
