      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-gsf36g",
      "text": "Doc, four wins deep and my hat's still heavier than my wallet, so I'll take your gold if you're offering. Newcomer owes half the building already, don't let him near your library tab. Roll the dice before rent finds me first.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
